{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:22 2026-05-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:22 2026-05-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:22 2026-05-12 HKT</p><p>今(12日)清晨6時許秀茂坪一輛巴士與密斗貨車於寶琳路寶達商場對開相撞，密斗貨車其後翻側，意外釀10人受傷。事後網上流出一段意外經過短片，可見巴士當時沿寶琳路綠燈行駛，惟過燈後，對面一部白色貨車由寶琳路右轉入寶達邨期間，與巴士相撞，貨車隨即翻側路面，懷疑貨車衝燈釀禍。</p><p>現場所見，涉事密斗貨車翻側後橫亙路中；巴士車頭擋風玻璃爆裂，嚴重損毀，碎片散落地面。</p><p></p><img alt=\"大批救援人員到場。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/715b72e02ae9f867e9dd970df3e2c553/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_071711273_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"貨車翻側。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a70d52799b7b1dfce652c394a4b218c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_071711273_11.jpg\"/><img alt=\"巴士嚴重損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3b168b1dc93e1bb65d5efbd727a98ad/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_071711273_13.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c76202dd5b95be38d55561e5ecb6d03c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072842913.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc2d197458433cc421758324926b8c69/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072842913_02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a337801838383ae951cfb29b95889c42/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072842913_07.jpg\"/><img alt=\"貨車男司機一度被困車內，他受輕傷自行爬出，在現場接受治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cce687e9808e12c902f12081c61ea53c/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-12_at_00_02_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多名巴士乘客受傷，由救護員進行治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6d048aaa53742715c1ea6b7c5bfb021/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-12_at_00_01_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"巴士司機受傷送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cdc99bb74a98c48d4745c71dc6fa5e9/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-12_at_00_01_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e66dc5c85a3af8eae2f468ff7089ad5/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072121332_07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46676edf55283483a74336ad06f236d7/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072121332_08.jpg\"/><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38891b41364233f37dc5bef22a15bdff/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072121332_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場交通擠塞。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d12b89b723b32003b0b796ebb29c38e/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072407686_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2b186274d7d7d9dbc683a8357ce11fa/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072407686_02_1_.jpg\"/><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T05:12:59.893768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}